# What does NOT get uploaded to Vercel.
#
# ⚠️ THE ENV LINES ARE LOAD-BEARING. Vercel falls back to .gitignore only while
# this file does not exist. The moment it does, every .gitignore rule stops
# applying — including the one keeping .env.local out — so the secrets would be
# uploaded into the deployment. Anything secret must be named here explicitly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example

# Not imported by the app, and some of it is not ours to ship: the ProductOS
# material is licensed, the design export is a reference, and since worktrees
# started landing under .claude/ a deploy was carrying a second full checkout
# of the repo.
.claude/
productos/
saaf-ai/
docs/
scripts/
*.local.md
